\title{[DP1] Greedy failure (1 pt)}
\date{2026-10-27T21:35:51Z}
\tag{algorithms}
\tag{problem}

\import{algorithms-macros}

\p{Show that the following greedy algorithm does not correctly
    solve this problem, by describing inputs for which it does not
    return the correct answer.}

\pseudo{
  \for{#{i \gets 1} to #{n}}{
    \if{#{N_i < S_i}}{
      \state{Output "NY in month #{i}"}
    }\else{
      \state{Output "SF in month #{i}"}
    }
  }
}

\p{In your example, be sure to explain what the correct answer is and
also what the above algorithm finds.}
